.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "fastq"
.PP
 \fR\fP

.PP
Fast, in memory work queue\&.

.PP
Benchmarks (1 million tasks):

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
setImmediate: 812ms
.IP "\(bu" 2
fastq: 854ms
.IP "\(bu" 2
async\&.queue: 1298ms
.IP "\(bu" 2
neoAsync\&.queue: 1249ms
.PP

.PP
Obtained on node 12\&.16\&.1, on a dedicated server\&.

.PP
If you need zero-overhead series function call, check out \fRfastseries\fP\&. For zero-overhead parallel function call, check out \fRfastparallel\fP\&.

.PP
\fR\fP
